{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6bee24b08e90df02dbb260657f3978c687e438a98616ed62f28616ecad528093", "ja": "（SFドラマ『ミリオンアーマー』シリーズの撮影日。\nレイカのアーマーが破損してしまうシーンだ……）", "zh": "（SF电视剧《百万装甲》系列的拍摄日。\n现在要拍的是丽花的装甲损坏的场景……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "cfe53de8a6dcbcfcf2e83af0071de49d213e3f00cb9b38330716c2319340369a", "ja": "「いたたたっ！？　う～ん、やられちゃいました。\nここは一時撤退です。次は負けないんだから！」", "zh": "“好痛痛痛！？唔～被打败了。\n这里就先暂时撤退吧。下次我可不会输的！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5eca42e7fe35c043c61b091380a6c83762779c5bb37acd8501f1999498c923ba", "ja": "（演技とはいえ、レイカやアーマーが傷つくシーンは\n胸が痛いな……）", "zh": "（虽然说是演技，但看到丽嘉或装甲受伤的场景，还是让人心里很难受……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "dcd92b0ecad7ef2783cfd76df4db9282fb02d2bb16c1246ae6251f3b96cfd070", "ja": "ぴー……がががっ、じー……\nじゃきじゃきじゃき……しゅぱーん……！", "zh": "哔——……滋滋滋，滋——……\n锵锵锵……唰——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e41b71affc61cf81befeaf265b572ac4fdc0e56008b9c4364496ca04060da23b", "ja": "新型のアーマーに着替えてきたんだな。\n……ところで、その音は、一体？", "zh": "你换上新型装甲了啊。\n……不过话说回来，那声音到底是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "4894100aa59e38bc08db3e60255f20598ba212d66f3a54f9ba23c0c899f6a810", "ja": "もちろん、新しいアーマーさんに合わせて、\n自分を改造してるんです♪", "zh": "当然是为了配合新的装甲先生，\n正在对自己进行改造呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "fb7bcc44bb7d6c07a4f3965f8efc7c2594928699615d6339b7f85b2be01aaf9c", "ja": "いろいろパワーアップしてもらえましたから、\n装備する私のパワーアップも必要かなって。", "zh": "既然得到了各种升级强化，\n我觉得穿戴装备的我也得跟着升级才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d79535f1e9044abd719446980bddc2e586aab05b3017843328d5d0fbacb92e96", "ja": "なるほど……。\n役にしっかり向き合ってくれてるんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……\n你一直都在认真面对这个角色啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "816471714ecf5625fa8172c788900dc21d651ea718c8aefeb73aca755dd87a2a", "ja": "はい！\n私、『ミリオンアーマー』の撮影が好きなんです。", "zh": "是的！\n我很喜欢《百万装甲》的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "10a64e3c5b7839c42e322620e6d5ca4f822712daa14bc69a6ef50edbd20a77f2", "ja": "なにしろ、空を自由に飛べますから♪\nもちろん、実際にはセットの中ですけど。", "zh": "毕竟可以自由地翱翔在天空中嘛♪\n当然，实际上是在布景里拍摄的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0dba08e72934a703fbed1641b8cee750cfa6a86fa1690dfef5211b09a034e539", "ja": "合成する前提の撮影だからな。でも臨場感を\n出すために風も吹いてるし、本格的だよな。", "zh": "毕竟拍摄本身就是为了后期合成嘛。不过为了营造\n临场感还特意吹了风，感觉相当专业呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "bd68aa6325e8b0440a5fd675e0bfacdc65e3b88edf425be8b6127f498bdabc03", "ja": "そうなんです！　本当に風の中にいるみたいで……。\nアーマーさんを着ることも大好きになっちゃいました♪", "zh": "就是这样！真的就像置身风中一样……而且，我也喜欢上穿装甲服了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d2e3ccfcf88a7f4feaf8d4505da8f2bb8c98c119bb481c5350acd50d3fcb88bd", "ja": "それはよかった。『ミリオンアーマー』のレイカは、\nどんなにつらい戦いでも、笑顔を忘れない役柄だ。", "zh": "那就好。《ミリオンアーマー》里的丽花，扮演的是无论战斗多么艰苦，都不会忘记保持笑容的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1013_p", "source_sha256": "65f975c71f140bf63bee05c8f6709ef6786a96e20d1602c76dfc33d9231d1c60", "ja": "麗花はそんな劇中のレイカと、\nしっかり繋がることができてるんだろうな。", "zh": "丽花应该已经和剧中的丽花紧密联系在一起了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "2114bf69b682c0a3fdd423dd200e379ba3e656d9c00709c67a1888a4f8eb68ef", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　でもさっきの戦いで、\nずっと一緒だったアーマーさんが、壊れちゃって……。", "zh": "谢谢您♪　不过在刚才的战斗中，\n一直陪着我的装甲先生坏掉了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "1038e36cc316f112b6c8c20c5fd520c8e194efabcb1feea10f8730e9b13434eb", "ja": "もう一緒に飛べないって思うと、\n悲しくなってきちゃいました……。", "zh": "一想到不能再一起飞行，\n我就觉得好难过啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dfbdd80d066a3633b6bcb1ffa6649ed66f8d544167b89821aaef3120aeced266", "ja": "それも役に入り込めているからこそだろうけど……。\nその気持ちを、新しいアーマーに向けるとか？", "zh": "不过，这大概也是因为你能完全投入角色吧……要不要把那份心情倾注到新的装甲上之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "c197f05ef95110505cb6cbb73f8be6b36c4287c00afd562a7169f637a988464a", "ja": "はい、壊れちゃった子の分も、これからこの新型さんで\nいっぱい空を飛びたいって思ってます♪", "zh": "是的，我也想连同那孩子的份一起，今后驾驶这位新型机在天空中尽情飞翔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "2143d901c8afa27781226250bd4c36ae9fdff864040a73dd3a6f2c012c22567d", "ja": "新型さんは整備班長ミヤちゃんお墨付きの高性能です\nから。しっかり使いこなせるよう、頑張りますね♪", "zh": "因为这款新型机可是整备班长美也认证的高性能机型。为了能熟练驾驭它，我会努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cf81f7f4a56ccc93563ade5f0bd3caac66ad886c6712663624df34a5948aa901", "ja": "ああ、パワーアップした『レイカ』を、\n敵にも味方にも、観客にも見せつけよう！", "zh": "啊，要把强化后的《丽花》，\n向敌人、伙伴以及观众们好好展示一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "e3d362a21695bbb4475b19ed0ae8134242c4ec0ce8e45e7c85cea234415fcf05", "ja": "はーい♪\nそれでは北上麗花Ver.2、出撃しまーすっ♪", "zh": "好——♪\n那么，北上丽花Ver.2，出击啦——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0584_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "aefbf414890b8f0f873aea1d3582e0389ddaff2fcea7ce1ee43c79c23a627e8a", "ja": "「わあ、すっごく速ーい！　これが新型さんの性能\nなんですね！　これなら、もう誰にも負けません！」", "zh": "“哇，好快好快～！这就是新型机的性能\n对吧！这样一来，就再也不会输给任何人了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
